.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I'm not sure these 2 features are related. 😅 \r\nPass-by-press: a finger started a touch outside the button, and the button can become pressed (not just hovered) if that same finger was moved onto it, while still touching the screen.\r\nClick margin: if a finger started a touch outside the button and it was moved onto it (including the margin), the button becomes hovered. It only becomes pressed if a new touch was started inside its zone that includes the margin. ","created_at":"2026-06-30T15:36:33Z","updated_at":"2026-06-30T15:36:33Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120693#discussion_r3499986950","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120693","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3499986950"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120693#discussion_r3499986950"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120693"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3499986950/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":2,"original_line":2,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":3499840128,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":3,"position":3,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3500050055","pull_request_review_id":4601897209,"id":3500050055,"no